{
    "title": "Stone Age: Settlement survival",
    "description": "Welcome to the Stone Age Survival Game! \ud83c\udf3f This captivating idle strategy game transports players back to the dawn of civilization, where they must navigate the challenges of settlement survival in the harsh conditions of the Stone Age.\r\n\r\nAs the leader of your tribe, it's up to you to oversee the development and growth of your settlement. Utilizing your strategic prowess as a city builder, you'll expand your territory, construct buildings, and fortify defenses to ensure the survival of your people in this primitive era.\r\n\r\nResource management is key to success in Stone Age Survival Game. You'll need to establish mines to extract valuable gold, essential for the prosperity and growth of your settlement. With every ounce of gold mined, you'll inch closer to ensuring the miners' settlement survival and the thriving of your community.\r\n\r\nBut survival in the Stone Age isn't just about gathering resources; it's about strategic planning and idle survival. Even when you're away, your settlement continues to evolve and thrive, with inhabitants working tirelessly to gather resources and maintain the settlement's infrastructure.\r\n\r\nIn this age of builder, you'll face challenges ranging from harsh weather conditions to threats from rival tribes. Only through careful planning, strategic decision-making, and effective base building games techniques can you ensure the longevity and prosperity of your settlement.\r\n\r\nStone Age Survival Game offers a unique blend of idle survival and city builder gameplay, providing players with an immersive experience that challenges them to overcome the obstacles of the Stone Age. Are you ready to embark on this epic journey and lead your tribe to survival and prosperity? The fate of your settlement rests in your hands! \ud83c\udfde\ufe0f",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the Stone Age Survival Game! \ud83c\udf3f This captivating idle strategy game transports players back to the dawn of civilization, where they must navigate the challenges of settlement survival in the harsh conditions of the Stone Age.<br><br>As the leader of your tribe, it&#39;s up to you to oversee the development and growth of your settlement. Utilizing your strategic prowess as a city builder, you&#39;ll expand your territory, construct buildings, and fortify defenses to ensure the survival of your people in this primitive era.<br><br>Resource management is key to success in Stone Age Survival Game. You&#39;ll need to establish mines to extract valuable gold, essential for the prosperity and growth of your settlement. With every ounce of gold mined, you&#39;ll inch closer to ensuring the miners&#39; settlement survival and the thriving of your community.<br><br>But survival in the Stone Age isn&#39;t just about gathering resources; it&#39;s about strategic planning and idle survival. Even when you&#39;re away, your settlement continues to evolve and thrive, with inhabitants working tirelessly to gather resources and maintain the settlement&#39;s infrastructure.<br><br>In this age of builder, you&#39;ll face challenges ranging from harsh weather conditions to threats from rival tribes. Only through careful planning, strategic decision-making, and effective base building games techniques can you ensure the longevity and prosperity of your settlement.<br><br>Stone Age Survival Game offers a unique blend of idle survival and city builder gameplay, providing players with an immersive experience that challenges them to overcome the obstacles of the Stone Age. Are you ready to embark on this epic journey and lead your tribe to survival and prosperity? The fate of your settlement rests in your hands! \ud83c\udfde\ufe0f",
